  "description": "MINVAI crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group C 2/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C40 H46 F24 N4 O36 P12 S16 Yb6,0.25(C1 H2 Cl2). From the CIF bond table, Yb1 (Yb) has 8 O neighbors; Yb2 (Yb) has 8 O neighbors; Yb3 (Yb) has 9 O neighbors; Yb1F (Yb) has 8 O neighbors; Yb2F (Yb) has 8 O neighbors; Yb3F (Yb) has 9 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 12 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.820-3.940 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 111.55-115.16°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C40H46Yb6F24N4O36P12S16. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 8 OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
